# Patterns without a leading **/ match the build context root only, so a bare
# `node_modules` would let every apps/*/node_modules and packages/*/node_modules
# (pnpm symlinks into the HOST store) into the image.
**/node_modules
.git
**/.turbo
**/dist
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
coverage
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
